@federal_committee
title: Revolt in the Federal Committee
new-page: true
tags: sp_event
view-if: revolt_possible = 1 and sanchez_leader = 1 and revolt_round < formation_round
on-arrival: {! Q.revolt_round = Q.formation_round || 1; !}

= Revolt in the Federal Committee

Half of the Federal Executive resigns at once, intending to force your fall. The critics demand a caretaker committee and an end to your strategy.

- @fight: Fight it out in the Federal Committee
- @members: Resign and take your case to the members

@fight
on-arrival: {!
Q.committee_won = (Q.federal_committee_balance + Q.member_morale / 5 >= 55) ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.committee_won) {
    Q.sanchez_authority += 10; Q.regional_leaders_dissent -= 10; Q.federal_committee_balance += 5;
} else {
    Q.sanchez_leader = 0;
    if (Q.in_leadership_window) {
        Q.leadership_exception_open = 1;
    }
}
!}
go-to: fight_won if committee_won = 1; ousted if committee_won = 0

@fight_won
title: You survive

= You survive

After a day of shouting in the corridors of Ferraz, the vote goes your way. Your critics will wait for another chance.

@members
on-arrival: sanchez_leader = 0; leadership_exception_open = 1 if in_leadership_window = 1
go-to: ousted

@ousted
title: Sánchez falls

= Sánchez falls

You are no longer Secretary-General. [? if leadership_exception_open = 1 : A caretaker committee takes over Ferraz. Your seat in Congress, your car, your office: all gone. But the members have not spoken yet, and the next primary is due in May 2017. ?]

@primary
title: The primary
new-page: true
tags: sp_event
view-if: leadership_exception_open = 1 and year >= 2017 and month >= 5
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.primary_won = (Q.member_morale + Q.sanchismo / 2 >= 60) ? 1 : 0;
Q.leadership_exception_open = 0;
if (Q.primary_won) {
    Q.sanchez_leader = 1; Q.sanchez_authority = 70; Q.sanchismo += 20; Q.member_morale += 10;
    Q.federal_committee_balance = 60;
}
!}

= The primary

[? if primary_won = 1 : The members vote, and they vote for you. Against the barons, the elders and the apparatus, Pedro Sánchez is Secretary-General again. ?][? if primary_won = 0 : The members vote, and they do not vote for you. ?]

@deadlock_vote
title: The King forces a vote
new-page: true
tags: sp_event
view-if: acting = 1 and investiture_votes = 0 and election_year = 0 and time >= formation_start_time + 4
on-arrival: {!
if (typeof window !== 'undefined' && window.SpainGame) {
    window.SpainGame.holdInvestiture(Q, 'pp');
}
!}

= The King forces a vote

Months have passed without a candidate facing the chamber, and without a first vote the constitutional clock cannot start. The King proposes the leader of the largest party once more, and this time he goes to the vote.

[? if acting = 1 : He loses it. The two-month clock has started: if no one is invested, the Cortes will be dissolved and Spain will vote again. ?][? if acting = 0 : He wins it. Spain has a government. ?]
